        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Although Samara Joy is only 25 years old, she has already become an important figure in the world of jazz. Three years ago, she, then 22 years old, took home two awards at the 2023 Grammys*—one for Best New Artist and another for Best New Jazz Vocal Album."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Samara Joy was born into a musical family in New York. Everybody in her family sings. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Under the influence of her family, her voice, the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tone",
            "ref": "v-tone"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "emotion",
            "ref": "v-emotion"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in her voice, and the way she sings have all improved."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". She started singing jazz in high school. After finishing high school, she chose to study jazz at college."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The young musician shares videos of her singing on "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "TikTok",
            "zh": "抖音海外版"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Among them are even famous actors and musicians."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The famous "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "composer",
            "zh": "作曲家"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Christian McBride said Samara’s voice is “full of "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "wisdom",
            "ref": "v-wisdom"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "”. “"
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ",” he said."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Samara has the greatest respect for jazz and its many artists before her. “They did so much to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "draw",
            "ref": "v-draw"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " people to this type of music,” she said. “It "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "deserves",
            "ref": "v-deserve"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to be talked about and shared. That’s also my goal—to share it.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "n1",
        "type": "note",
        "content": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "*Grammys：格莱美奖，是由美国国家科学院录音艺术与科学学院于1958年设立的音乐类奖项。该奖项涵盖流行、摇滚、说唱、乡村、爵士、拉丁、古典等多种音乐类型，由专业人士投票决定每一年的奖项获得者。"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
